---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import sticker from '../../brand/logo/sticker.png';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who makes Silly Willy Apps, and why there are no ads.">
  <div class="about">
    <h1>Hi, I'm Paul.</h1>
    <p>I grew up with games that had a beginning and an end. You played them, you finished them, and nothing popped up in the middle asking you to buy a season pass.</p>
    <p>By day I'm a software engineer in education technology. It's work I care about. But big projects come with a lot of process, and sometimes an idea just wants to be built on a Tuesday night.</p>
    <p>That's what Silly Willy is: the apps and games I make after hours, because I want them to exist. No ads, ever. Some have a small optional purchase; some you just buy once and play it all.</p>
    <p>If you've played one of them, thank you. Really. That's the best part.</p>
    <p class="sign hand">— Paul</p>
  </div>
  <Image src={sticker} alt="Silly Willy, apps &amp; games" width={260} densities={[1, 2]} class="sticker" />
</Base>

<style>
  .about { max-width: 620px; }
  .about p { font-size: 18px; }
  .sign { font-size: 30px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .sticker { display: block; margin: 32px 0 0; }
</style>
